### MTO Notification API - IntelliJ HTTP Client
@host = localhost
@port = 8086
@baseUrl = http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/notifications
@keycloakUrl = http://auth.mto.local:8082
@realm = mto
@clientId = mto-frontend
@username = notificacion.responsable
@password = local

### Auth - access token (notificacion.lector / .auditor / .responsable, password 'local')
POST {{keycloakUrl}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username={{username}}&password={{password}}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.access_token);
%}

### Health (no token)
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/actuator/health

### --- Mi bandeja (notification-inbox) -----------------------------------------------------------

### Mis notificaciones, mas reciente primero
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox?size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Solo las no leidas, y solo las criticas
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox?unread=true&severity=CRITICAL&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### El contador de la campana ({count, capped})
GET {{baseUrl}}/inbox/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Marcar una como leida (404 NTF-404 si no me va dirigida)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inbox/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Marcar todas como leidas (hasta la mas reciente visible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inbox/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### --- El registro (notification-activity-read) ---------------------------------------------------

### Actividad de configuracion, mas reciente primero
GET {{baseUrl}}/activity?category=CONFIGURATION&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Lo que hizo una persona sobre un tipo de entidad, ordenado por llegada
GET {{baseUrl}}/activity?actorUsername=config.responsable&subjectType=profile&sort=seq,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Un evento con su payload
GET {{baseUrl}}/activity/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### category=ACCESS es 400 VAL-001: los accesos tienen su endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/activity?category=ACCESS
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### --- Los accesos (notification-access-read) -----------------------------------------------------

### Accesos de una persona
GET {{baseUrl}}/access?username=config.responsable&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Fallos, rachas y bloqueos desde una IP
GET {{baseUrl}}/access?ipAddress=172.18.0.1&outcome=FAILURE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### --- Administracion (notification-admin) --------------------------------------------------------

### Las reglas cargadas y de donde vienen
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Estado de las fuentes: marcas del lector de Keycloak, inbox por fuente, rafagas, entregas
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Entregas de correo que fallaron
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/deliveries?status=FAILED&channel=email
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reintentar una entrega FAILED o SKIPPED (409 DLV-409 en otro estado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/deliveries/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Un correo de prueba (202; en local aparece en Mailpit, http://localhost:8025)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/test-email
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": "ops@mto.local"}

### Un aviso manual (201 + Location); 422 NTF-422 con una audiencia o un canal desconocidos
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/broadcasts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Parada programada del sabado",
  "body": "El backoffice no estara disponible el sabado de 08:00 a 10:00.",
  "link": "/notificaciones",
  "severity": "WARNING",
  "audiences": ["PROFILE:mto-ops", "CLIENT_ROLE:mto-notification-api:notification-inbox"],
  "channels": ["inbox", "email"]
}
